annel_join","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"a9fcbe30-afdb-4436-98b1-746fd4ae455b","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"ありがとうございます、試してみます","ts":"1628039419.170400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=MU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0d3e39f2-076e-4105-a526-704d1392fb18","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":":naruhodo:","ts":"1628039414.170200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6CYB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a9014ce0-5fef-4653-af39-3ee97e2e3293","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"あとはナイアシンですね。これはカツオに多く含まれてますので、たたきを生わさびをつけて食すといいと思われます。","ts":"1628039261.170000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3=nU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"646104bd-46f9-49fe-bb81-44e17a696687","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"あー、一つ注意点ですが「ビタミンA」はサプリなどで過剰摂取すると逆に身体を壊す事になるので摂るなら「β-カロテン」がいいです。","ts":"1628039169.168700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"215"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3088e8a9-fb0f-4143-ad11-9bb077940d26","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"ありがとうございます","ts":"1628038785.167400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1+w"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4551fd52-9fbf-4e8e-b6d7-293719125fe0","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"なるほど\nビタミンCも摂っていますが、Aは摂っていなかったんので帰りに買います","ts":"1628038783.167200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"It8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"483cd63f-3bfe-443c-80ca-d9e12e7c2684","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"特に夏場はビタミンCが不足気味になりますので。","ts":"1628038402.166500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"rTO4+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"08a60ece-15ca-49ff-b93f-ba3f00b5f8d0","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"β-カロテン（ビタミンA）とビタミンCも摂らないと意味ないですよ。","ts":"1628038312.165900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"AdC5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d5ef6e65-2247-4ea5-87f1-7dd6899a3878","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"自分もそう思って、ビタミンB コンプレックスのサプルを摂っていますが、それでもダルいので多分違うと思われます","ts":"1628038156.165300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Q6h9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"53c741b5-e501-42af-98d2-bbe3163cca79","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"ビタミン不足じゃないですか？","ts":"1628037198.164300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"n6A"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5E3F5933-4B37-4A77-95DA-5196256AA08E","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"食欲もりもりだけど","ts":"1628037150.164000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"m4X"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7181575E-FDEA-4B0C-B8A7-C7E6E333C9E9","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"夏バテか？","ts":"1628037144.163700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"PIegx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"A1064E5F-76F0-4A76-8CBA-268475EF8EBC","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"いっぱい寝てみたけど倦怠感変わらず","ts":"1628037133.163300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fZM"}]}]
